WEBVTT

00:02:59.958 --> 00:03:01.625
Let that little girl dance."

00:03:02.708 --> 00:03:03.976
Or why --

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:05.309
(Applause)

00:03:05.333 --> 00:03:08.643
Why didn't the white patrons
in the segregated restaurants say

00:03:08.667 --> 00:03:10.393
"Hey, that's not right.

00:03:10.417 --> 00:03:12.167
Let that family eat."

00:03:12.958 --> 00:03:15.184
Well, it didn't take me long to realize

00:03:15.208 --> 00:03:18.726
that racial injustice
wasn't the only place

00:03:18.750 --> 00:03:22.351
that people in the majority
were staying quiet.

00:03:22.375 --> 00:03:25.518
When I'd sit in church and hear
some homophobic comment

00:03:25.542 --> 00:03:27.601
being disguised as something scriptural,

00:03:27.625 --> 00:03:30.518
I'd say, "I'm sorry,